<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 rebels have seized a major town in eastern DRC, breaking a ceasefire and intensifying clashes with the Congolese army. ADF gunmen continue killing civilians in Ituri province amid the ongoing Ebola outbreak. An ISIL affiliate in the DRC has evolved into a self-reliant insurgency sustained by conflict gold. A Chinese national was abducted and two people were killed in a deadly ambush at Kalemie. The conflict caused 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/16/world/europe/deport-rwanda-asylum-migration.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/16/eu-states-immigration-return-hubs-rwanda&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2026/11/16/five-european-countries-agree-deport-rejected-asylum-seekers-rwanda/&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNeVROV1dYLXh2Nk43QzBKUVRsRS1aUXJHMlQxZDBmODN6RnV4RlpyZEdRci1YVnhqOWxsUVdnZV9VMlpsT2h2TWFZREZTbU0zc2o0ZHVLTFVZR0ltV1VHRHFfcnZGQndGWlIzdGxZc0JORFNpMUdTb25OZVR4a19fVjJVTXIxRGFtd1JV?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;thesentry.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPaTdEZFVLODdScE9ZSGFoQTNQZ0Z2NzBMSWg1TDBieDYzSjcxZnlPdUNHMmFhcnVSZXAxdWFhS2JxRTJ3ZmhxNUMtQjBNc0l3Wkp3Qks1clRFTVA5cTFGTS1nTk5ZZHZoQ0t6RW5QUF9oWWtRRTB2RXVvZkZBbkwwWDdQZi1qTXlJYlpkN25QaDNOUDdOcUZsM1ItVFE5SHBsOFZCcGprSmc3dms?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Tanzania Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQYTUtZVlneFdRVWwtTTFuYVRiYjVZUklnZ2RUS2RSQU43N2ZFcFVCZXl3eGxfaEM3azFVZ2dFbkoyektVUTNRWWNmTTlrZEZLNVNoWTRhUmsyMEp0cXhZcWI3eldoclZsVDY1RUUxZnBRMWRfZHpD